      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Dredging has unearthed charred tree stumps, supporting a theory that Lake Waccamaw is the basin left by a prehistoric peat fire.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
